WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.146
Welcome to the Federal Modernization
Workbook's developer workbook,

2
00:00:04.146 --> 00:00:05.912
Building Non-Person Identity.

3
00:00:05.912 --> 00:00:09.762
This is Chapter 3: the
migration path matrix as code.

4
00:00:09.762 --> 00:00:14.512
Every service account and app needs a
decision before anything is converted,

5
00:00:14.512 --> 00:00:19.559
and this chapter turns the book's matrix
into reviewed data and code that proposes

6
00:00:19.559 --> 00:00:24.087
a target, checks the owner's choice,
sequences the waves and checks the gate.

7
00:00:24.087 --> 00:00:26.852
We'll start from Learn's
own decision tables,

8
00:00:26.852 --> 00:00:30.999
see what they leave out, then walk
the code, two labs and the dangers.

9
00:00:30.999 --> 00:00:36.220
One note before we begin: the code is
illustrative, tested against fixtures.
